{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STOP RUNNING AND YOU DIE.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rogue Runner</strong> is a high-octane blend of <strong>Parkour</strong> mechanics and <strong>TPS</strong>\u00a0<strong>Roguelite</strong> combat. In a world glitching with infinite improbability, speed is your only ally. Run without slowing down, avoid traps, and eliminate enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run. Shoot. Evolve. Repeat.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332790/extras/921a698669e4b751b5a238bad333ec7c.poster.avif?t=1773499048\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332790/extras/921a698669e4b751b5a238bad333ec7c.webm?t=1773499048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332790/extras/921a698669e4b751b5a238bad333ec7c.mp4?t=1773499048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHAOS IS PROCEDURAL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two runs are ever the same. The &quot;Machine of Improbability&quot; constantly reshapes the world, generating new map layouts, enemy placements, and trap configurations every time you die. Master the maps to gain an advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332790/extras/a2644b56fced4d0098388547bb9e73ab.poster.avif?t=1773499048\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332790/extras/a2644b56fced4d0098388547bb9e73ab.webm?t=1773499048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332790/extras/a2644b56fced4d0098388547bb9e73ab.mp4?t=1773499048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CRAFT YOUR ULTIMATE BUILD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no \u201cright\u201d way to break this cycle, only your way. Combine different weapons with different skills. Do you want to take out every enemy with a single bullet, empty all your bullets in a second, or go into battle with powerful turrets that will fight for you? The choice is entirely yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332790/extras/1a85c93afffdd270404cb3e72ed63ea5.poster.avif?t=1773499048\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332790/extras/1a85c93afffdd270404cb3e72ed63ea5.webm?t=1773499048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332790/extras/1a85c93afffdd270404cb3e72ed63ea5.mp4?t=1773499048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fluid Parkour System: </strong>Navigate complex environments with wall runs, ziplines, swings, and skiing movements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Global Leaderboards: </strong>Don't just survive compete. Run to reach the top spot and show the world your best score.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Merchant System:</strong> Encounter merchants during your run to buy upgrades or take risks with cursed cards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full Controller Support:</strong> Optimized for Steam Deck and standard controllers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Special Bosses:</strong> A unique boss experience awaits you with boss battles designed for the runner mechanic.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A THIEF'S STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alara is a notorious thief who steals dangerous machines. One day, when things go wrong during a heist, she is forced to use the machine she stole. But what she doesn't know is that this machine is a machine of infinite improbability. The machine traps Alara inside its own world of improbability. And the only way out is to break the cycle.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3332790?t=1773499048","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3332790?t=1773499048","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332790/a6f725165e633aeac984434b3911a538c0b43a21/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773499048","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332790/a6f725165e633aeac984434b3911a538c0b43a21/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773499048","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3689050,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STOP RUNNING AND YOU DIE.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rogue Runner</strong> is a high-octane blend of <strong>Parkour</strong> mechanics and <strong>TPS</strong>\u00a0<strong>Roguelite</strong> combat. In a world glitching with infinite improbability, speed is your only ally. Run without slowing down, avoid traps, and eliminate enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run. Shoot. Evolve. Repeat.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332790/extras/921a698669e4b751b5a238bad333ec7c.poster.avif?t=1773499048\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332790/extras/921a698669e4b751b5a238bad333ec7c.webm?t=1773499048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332790/extras/921a698669e4b751b5a238bad333ec7c.mp4?t=1773499048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHAOS IS PROCEDURAL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two runs are ever the same. The &quot;Machine of Improbability&quot; constantly reshapes the world, generating new map layouts, enemy placements, and trap configurations every time you die. Master the maps to gain an advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332790/extras/a2644b56fced4d0098388547bb9e73ab.poster.avif?t=1773499048\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332790/extras/a2644b56fced4d0098388547bb9e73ab.webm?t=1773499048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332790/extras/a2644b56fced4d0098388547bb9e73ab.mp4?t=1773499048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CRAFT YOUR ULTIMATE BUILD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no \u201cright\u201d way to break this cycle, only your way. Combine different weapons with different skills. Do you want to take out every enemy with a single bullet, empty all your bullets in a second, or go into battle with powerful turrets that will fight for you? The choice is entirely yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332790/extras/1a85c93afffdd270404cb3e72ed63ea5.poster.avif?t=1773499048\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332790/extras/1a85c93afffdd270404cb3e72ed63ea5.webm?t=1773499048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332790/extras/1a85c93afffdd270404cb3e72ed63ea5.mp4?t=1773499048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fluid Parkour System: </strong>Navigate complex environments with wall runs, ziplines, swings, and skiing movements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Global Leaderboards: </strong>Don't just survive compete. Run to reach the top spot and show the world your best score.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Merchant System:</strong> Encounter merchants during your run to buy upgrades or take risks with cursed cards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full Controller Support:</strong> Optimized for Steam Deck and standard controllers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Special Bosses:</strong> A unique boss experience awaits you with boss battles designed for the runner mechanic.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A THIEF'S STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alara is a notorious thief who steals dangerous machines. One day, when things go wrong during a heist, she is forced to use the machine she stole. But what she doesn't know is that this machine is a machine of infinite improbability. The machine traps Alara inside its own world of improbability. And the only way out is to break the cycle.</p>","developers":["42nd Machine"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332790/3083fd8b59e5bcb76a1daabf4ecb94201823e2fb/header.jpg?t=1773499048","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3332790/1575179732/07888aaa7ff07b7a57c9d1b3a085ff0ce123b070/1767696757/dash_av1.mpd?t=1772103688","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3332790/1575179732/07888aaa7ff07b7a57c9d1b3a085ff0ce123b070/1767696757/dash_h264.mpd?t=1772103688","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3332790/1575179732/07888aaa7ff07b7a57c9d1b3a085ff0ce123b070/1767696757/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1772103688","id":257260492,"name":"Demo V2 - Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257260492/2591042fd065d8925f507e142c4f8f4a500ad695/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1772103688"}],"name":"Rogue Runner","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-2500K / AMD FX - 6300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 970 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","re